r.h('Assumptions constraints and dependencies')
r.h('Assumptions',2)
tab('Assumptions and consequences if false',['ID','Assumption','Consequence and response'],[
('AS-01','Internet is available for selected cloud OCR and assistant operations.','If unavailable, show failure and offer manual entry; optional offline drafts do not promise offline AI.'),('AS-02','Users can provide legible supported printed receipt images and review uncertain output.','Poor images use recapture or manual correction. No universal handwriting or Urdu OCR promise is made.'),('AS-03','The team can access an affordable OCR and language-model option.','Validate cost and limits early; use replaceable interfaces and test substitutes. Budget and vendor are not yet established.'),('AS-04','A representative Android device and consented trial users can be obtained.','Document any emulator-only or unrepresentative evaluation and seek the missing validation rather than claiming it occurred.'),('AS-05','Stored records may be incomplete relative to real spending.','Summaries and suggestions explicitly describe recorded data and their date ranges.')],[.65,2.5,2.87])
r.h('Constraints',2)
r.p('The project is a four-student BS Computer Science FYP at Beaconhouse National University for academic year 2026-2027 under Nouman Ali. The approved scope, single-account boundary and existing delivery priorities constrain implementation. No exact development budget or confirmed submission deadline is established for D3. The team must select a financially feasible deployment during architecture work; this document does not invent a budget ceiling or a semester delivery schedule.')
r.p('The interface is oriented to personal and household expenses, not journal-entry operators. The baseline currency is PKR and the initial interface can be English. Full English and Urdu localisation is Should Have. Privacy, source provenance, corrected categories and coherent monetary totals are constraints on every implementation choice. No vendor, programming language, mobile framework or database is mandated.')
r.h('Technical dependencies',2)
tab('Dependency contracts and acceptance evidence',['Dependency','Required contract','Risk and validation'],[
('Identity and storage','Account identity, protected operations, stable records, atomic save and version-aware revisions.','Early two-account and interrupted-save tests; inspect ownership and storage configuration.'),('OCR component','Supported image to original text and structured candidates, explicit errors and missing fields.','Evaluate T5 before optional feature work; retain manual fallback and measurable provider latency.'),('Category and product interpretation','Proposed classifications with uncertainty and separate identities.','Use local vocabulary and controlled fixtures; preserve user corrections.'),('AI model and retrieval','Natural-language question to bounded authorised retrieval and explainable answer; read-only access.','Verify deterministic calculations separately, inspect payloads and test prompt-based boundary violations.'),('Device and network','Camera/file input, readable core UI and observable network states.','Run actual Android acceptance scenarios and failure injection.'),('Optional speech and export','Speech produces editable text; export produces an owned data selection.','Evaluate only if selected; no core workflow depends on them.'),('Optional localisation and notifications','Translated strings, RTL rendering and local scheduling permissions.','Bilingual review and device-permission tests; defer explicitly if not validated.')],[1.1,2.55,2.37])

r.h('Out of scope');r.p(EXCLUDED)
r.p('These exclusions apply to the current delivery. Internal expense-account mappings do not imply payroll, commercial accounting or tax filing. An assistant that explains recorded spending does not control financial accounts. A shopkeeper\'s expense entry does not create inventory, sales or payment-processing functionality.')
r.h('Future scope');r.p(FUTURE)
r.p('Future work requires a new approved scope decision and traceability update. Analysis of repeated recorded expenses is currently supported; creating recurring expenses is future work. Descriptive observations about high recorded spending are current; predictive anomaly infrastructure is future work. Potential deeper Urdu support is distinct from the currently optional bilingual interface and Urdu interaction.')

